# One term per line. Blank lines and lines beginning with '#' are ignored; the
# scan builds a case-insensitive regex alternation from the remaining lines.
# These are the prior-host CODENAMEs that must never reach the public remote —
# distinctive, zero false-positive risk. Extracted from the previously-inline
# scan list (S8-T5g) so the maintained list is data, not code.
#
# This file is itself EXCLUDED from the scan (it necessarily CONTAINS the terms)
# — see the ':(exclude).prepush_terms' pathspec in scripts/prepush_scan.sh §1.
#
# NOTE: 'ai1' is intentionally NOT listed — too short, real false-positive risk
# in identifiers/base64; it is already scrubbed and review catches a regression.
